74,"description":"Playable without Timed Input"},{"id":79,"description":"Save Anytime"},{"id":77,"description":"Touch Only Option"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":17,"description":"Includes level editor"},{"id":44,"description":"Remote Play Together"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}]}},"content":{"status":"success","steamAppId":"1967510","steamName":"Railbound","sourceUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1967510/","fetchedAt":"2026-10-16T08:21:14.946940+00:00","locales":{"en":{"status":"source","provider":"steam","shortDescription":"A relaxing puzzle game about fixing train connections and travelling the world - now with a level editor!","detailedDescription":"Railbound is a comfy track-bending puzzle game about a pair of dogs on a train journey around the world. \n\nConnect and sever railways across the world to help everyone reach their homes and solve over 240 clever puzzles ranging from gentle slopes to twisted passageways. \n\nBEND RAILS TO MAKE THE TRAIN GO ‘CHOO-CHOO’\n\nPlace, remove and reroute connections so that carriages safely connect to the locomotive. But, be careful and don’t make them run into each other! \n\n240+ PUZZLES TO COMPLETE\n\nOur main levels will take you through a variety of locations at a relaxed pace. Forks along the road will lead you to spicy brainteasers that’ll please even the most demanding players! \n\nTRAIN-INSPIRED MECHANICS\n\nUse tunnels to cover vast distances in an instant. Delay trains using well-timed railway barriers. Switch tracks to reroute cars in different directions. Pick up cute friends on the way and encounter even more challenges on your journey! \n\nART AND MUSIC FULL OF WHOLESOME VIBES\n\nAcross the game’s world enjoy our comic-book-inspired visuals and a relaxing original soundtrack by the team behind Golf Peaks and inbento.\n\n \n\nGO OFF THE RAILS WITH THE LEVEL EDITOR\n\n240+ puzzles are not enough? Try out the level editor mode, create your own challenges, share them with the world via Steam Workshop or check out other people's puzzles!","aboutGame":null},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967510/0bcb8a1233c7b4dcd5b9747a390cd924f55340d2/header.jpg?t=1788161967"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967510/cd995c5075a1f0359bb6051b09c1be3fdbbfbe7e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788161967"},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967510/extras/e3ba310220bcbc503ff6495aefef8a0a.avif?t=1788161967","alt":""}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967510/ss_c24f2a15db68a95112ae1eb46251b53a5639f2ae.600x338.jpg?t=1788161967","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967510/ss_c24f2a15db68a95112ae1eb46251b53a5639f2ae.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788161967"},{"id":1,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967510/ss_21b8fe787411d76675e4725be6a557ca66bd33fa.600x338.jpg?t=1788161967","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967510/ss_21b8fe787411d76675e4725be6a557ca66bd33fa.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788161967"},{"id":2,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967510/ss_7bae80627c7cdb0870a8fb167ddaf41503ec379d.600x338.jpg?t=1788161967","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967510/ss_7bae80627c7cdb0870a8fb167ddaf41503ec379d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788161967"},{"id":3,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967510/ss_5d12dadf7308d7d603ca257dfa2f7cb1e0da5d1e.600x338.jpg?t=1788161967","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967510/ss_5d12dadf7308d7d603ca257df